        <li class="block-list-terms-section">
          <span class="block-list-terms-header">Scope and Applicability</span>
          <ol class="ordered-list-decimal">
            <li>
              This Testing IP Block List Terms and Conditions
              (the “Agreement”) is a legal agreement between you (“You”) and Cisco Systems, Inc.
              (“Cisco”) and governs Your use of the testing IP block list (the “List”). By downloading,
              installing or using any of the List, you agree that this Agreement with Cisco is enforceable
              like any written contract signed by You. If You do not agree to all of the terms and
              conditions contained in this Agreement, then Cisco is unwilling to license the List to You,
              in which case You may not download, install or use any of the List. If You do not agree to the
              terms and conditions of this Agreement, do not download, install or use the List. by selecting
              “i accept,” “ok,” “continue,” “yes,” “next” or by installing or using the List in any way, you
              are indicating your complete understanding and acceptance of all of the terms and conditions of
              this Agreement.
            </li>
