              right to download and use the List to test IP blocking functionality. You agree that the
              List is only part of the comprehensive IP block list provided by Talos through Cisco’s
              security products and does not provide adequate protection.
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="block-list-terms-emphasis">Limits on Usage</span>. You may not:
              <ol class="ordered-list-alphabetical">
